The pagination has no upper limit of pages.

lib/WWW/MetaForge/ArcRaiders.pm:323-331 runs while (1) and breaks only when the pagination says hasNextPage is false. The same shape is in the other list methods of the distribution.

Failure case: the API answers (a bug or a changed format) again and again with hasNextPage => 1. The loop runs with HTTP requests without end, there is no way out, and the cache grows without limit.

Decide: the pagination gets a maximum number of pages (100) as a further condition of the break.

Commit eb60625 auf Branch k14-k16 (max_pages, Seitengrenze, Warnung); Test t/34-pagination-limit.t; Suite gruen.

